  "translation": "This morning, my mother and I went to the supermarket together to buy things. We first looked at the vegetable area. We arrived outside the supermarket, first took a shopping cart. Inside the supermarket there were many goods. My favorite fruit was on the left side. Mother asked: \"How many apples do you want to buy?\" I said: \"Buy five.\" We also bought milk and bread. Mother wanted to buy some tomatoes, but there were none. When paying, I discovered there were many people queuing in front. We waited for ten minutes. Then we walked home together."
